<div class="govuk-grid-row">
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">

        <h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">Existing heat networks</h1>
        <h2 class="govuk-heading-l">Overview</h2>

        <p class="govuk-body">
            Use this section to find the Technical Standard and Assessment Procedures
            for existing heat networks under the Heat Network Technical Assurance Scheme (HNTAS).
        </p>

        <p class="govuk-body">
            These documents set out the minimum technical requirements for heat networks
            that are already operational and explain how compliance is assessed during
            operation and ongoing use.
        </p>

        <p class="govuk-body">
            Documents in this section are organised by assessment stage to help you find
            the documents that apply to your heat network.
        </p>

        <p class="govuk-body">
            They are intended for organisations responsible for owning or operating
            existing heat networks. Documents may be updated as the scheme develops.
        </p>

        <p class="govuk-body">Contents</p>

        <ul class="govuk-list">
            <li class="govuk-body">
                —
                <a href="#" class="govuk-link govuk-link--no-visited-state" rel="noreferrer noopener"> Operation(initial)</a>
                <p class="govuk-body">
                    Technical requirements and assessment procedures that apply when an
                    existing heat network first enters assessment under HNTAS.
                </p>
            </li>

            <li class="govuk-body">
                —
                <a href="#" class="govuk-link govuk-link--no-visited-state" rel="noreferrer noopener"> Operation (ongoing)</a>
                <p class="govuk-body">
                    Requirements and procedures for ongoing operation, monitoring and
                    continued compliance with HNTAS.
                </p>
            </li>

            <li>
                —
                <a href="#" class="govuk-link govuk-link--no-visited-state" rel="noreferrer noopener"> End of life and major changes</a>
                <p class="govuk-body">
                    Documents covering decommissioning, replacement or significant
                    changes to an existing heat network.
                </p>
            </li>
        </ul>

    </div>
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-one-third">
        <aside class="app-related-items" role="complementary">
            <h2 class="govuk-heading-s govuk-!-margin-top-0" id="related-content-heading"
